(Northwind Analytics - Compensation Philosophy \(FY2026\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Principles) Tj T*
(We pay at the 60th percentile of the market for the relevant talent pool and) Tj T*
(location, and we review the benchmark twice a year. Pay decisions are based on) Tj T*
(the band for the role, not on negotiation leverage.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Bands and progression) Tj T*
(Every role maps to a band from B1 to B6. Movement within a band reflects) Tj T*
(sustained performance; movement between bands requires a promotion case that is) Tj T*
(reviewed in calibration.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Bonus) Tj T*
(Bonus targets range from 5 percent of base at B1 to 40 percent at B6. Company) Tj T*
(performance is weighted 70 percent and individual performance 30 percent.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Equity) Tj T*
(Equity grants are made at B4 and above on joining and on promotion, with a four) Tj T*
(year vest and a one year cliff.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Off-cycle adjustments) Tj T*
(Off-cycle adjustments above 8 percent require People leadership and Finance) Tj T*
(approval, and are reported to the compensation committee each quarter.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Confidentiality) Tj T*
(Individual compensation is confidential. Managers may discuss bands and the) Tj T*
(reasoning behind a decision, never another employee's figure.) Tj T*
ET
